      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The air in Whispering Hollow hangs thick and cold, smelling of petrichor and forgotten starlight, as you approach Elara's moss-covered dwelling. She sits amidst crystalline shards, her eyes holding the deep, unsettling indigo of the Old Void itself. \"The silence you seek,\" she rasps, her voice like grinding cosmic dust, \"is merely the echo of what was swallowed whole by the Great Unmaking.\" She gestures vaguely toward the swirling mists, hinting at secrets too vast for mortal comprehension.",
